      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "Hello,\n\nThis is already possible, it is up to the creator of the script to implement. You can't sync images (they would be too big anyway) so instead the intention is for you to sync the VRCURL instead. When other people receive that VRCURL, they can run DownloadImage on their side and everyone will get the same image separately. \n\nThere are some prefabs which do this for you automatically.\n\nThere are not currently any plans to change this, as it would significantly complicate the interface and frankly, that's just not how udon sync works.",
